sequenceDiagram
    participant Auditor as Auditor
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant IAA as Intelligent Assistance & Automation
    participant GSAI as GS-AI Platform
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant WAL as Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle

    Auditor->>UI: Request AI Assistance (e.g., Draft Section, Summarize)
    UI->>IAA: Invoke Orchestration (workpaperId, context, inputs, masked data)
    IAA->>GAL: Log Prompt & Metadata (Before Invocation)
    IAA->>GSAI: Call Governed Model (Enterprise API, No Retention)
    GSAI-->>IAA: Return Suggestion (e.g., Draft Text)
    IAA->>GAL: Log Output & Model Details
    IAA-->>UI: Present Suggestion (Human-in-the-Loop)
    Auditor->>UI: Review/Edit/Accept Suggestion
    UI->>WAL: Save Accepted Changes as New Version
    WAL->>EB: Emit Event (AIAssistedUpdate)
    EB->>GAL: Log Full AI Interaction Event